\arccos(\cos 76^\circ) &= \arccos(\cos((180-104)^\circ)) \\
&= \arccos(\cos(76^\circ)) \text{ (since $\cos x = \cos(-x)$) } \qquad \text{(as desired); QED}
\end{align*}

Now we can write our answer:

\boxed{76}

